"r":"Trader","n":"#1236","p":50,"im":["375a47cb469017229bb732c7cdf1b2ee0bece0d2"],"ib":{"375a47cb469017229bb732c7cdf1b2ee0bece0d2":0},"m":1236},{"id":"dbrrbd_p50_1237","t":"","a":"JB888","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#1237","p":50,"im":["4315d22c600729c7b8bc89f7ddc61ad2be1c7fff"],"ib":{"4315d22c600729c7b8bc89f7ddc61ad2be1c7fff":0},"m":1237},{"id":"dbrrbd_p50_1238","t":"","a":"JB888","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#1238","p":50,"im":["18516a9e67dbb90ea21cff15c6dbd7c9fc3a4613"],"ib":{"18516a9e67dbb90ea21cff15c6dbd7c9fc3a4613":0},"m":1238},{"id":"dbrrbd_p50_1239","t":"","a":"JB888","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#1239","p":50,"im":["4ecd48fa995294dc73599f038a8855b110df672c"],"ib":{"4ecd48fa995294dc73599f038a8855b110df672c":0},"m":1239},{"id":"dbrrbd_p50_1240","t":"","a":"JB888","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#1240","p":50,"im":["0da3a12435360b9133ebfed5fd9c4109954a8c4f"],"ib":{"0da3a12435360b9133ebfed5fd9c4109954a8c4f":0},"m":1240},{"id":"dbrrbd_p50_1241","t":"","a":"JB888","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#1241","p":50,"im":["93e4c82b7ca5d468f25f5b5203301319321325b1"],"ib":{"93e4c82b7ca5d468f25f5b5203301319321325b1":0},"m":1241},{"id":"dbrrbd_p50_1242","t":"","a":"JB888","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#1242","p":50,"im":["c3d9bbc4317e335d1bea5f29003b940b985242f7"],"ib":{"c3d9bbc4317e335d1bea5f29003b940b985242f7":0},"m":1242},{"id":"dbrrbd_p50_1243","t":"HI m new to this PA n posting a chart of usd/chf M1 in the last minutes of market on friday... i hv asked sm queries kindly reply me as i dnt knw anything n want to learn PA properly... n please leave ur suggestions n if i hv made any mistakes kindly lemme know so that i can improve upon them...\n\nregards\n\nnys","a":"nysforex","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#1243","p":50,"im":["0c53cce97365f88b96fcfe1319c1cc6f2d5dcfc2"],"fa":"سلام، من در PA تازه‌ام و چارتی از usd/chf M1 در دقایق آخر بازار روز جمعه می‌گذارم… چند سؤال هم پرسیده‌ام، لطفاً جوابم را بدهید چون هیچی نمی‌دانم و می‌خواهم PA را درست یاد بگیرم… لطفاً پیشنهادهایتان را هم بگذارید و اگر اشتباهی کرده‌ام بگویید تا بهتر شوم…\n\nبا احترام\n\nnys","ib":{"0c53cce97365f88b96fcfe1319c1cc6f2d5dcfc2":3},"m":1243},{"id":"dbrrbd_p50_1244","t":"pin bar is more like this\n\nCharacteristics of the Pin Bar Formation\n\n• The pin bar should have a long upper or lower tail…the tail is also sometimes called the “wick” or the “shadow”…they all mean the same thing. It’s the “pointy” part of the pin bar that literally looks like a “tail” and that shows rejection or false break of a level.\n\n• The area between the open and close of the pin bar is called the “body” or “real body”. It is typically colored white or another light color when the close was higher than the open and black or another dark color when the close was lower than the open.\n\n• The open and close of the pin bar should be very close together or equal (same price), the closer the better.\n\n• The open and close of the pin bar are near one end of the bar, the closer to the end the better.\n\n• The shadow or tail of the pin bar sticks out (protrudes) from the surrounding price bars, the longer the tail of the pin bar the better.\n\n• A general “rule of thumb” is that you want to see the pin bar tail be two/thirds the total pin bar length or more and the rest of the pin bar should be one/third the total pin bar length or less.\n\n• The end opposite the tail is sometimes referred to as the “nose”","a":"roqallo","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#1244","p":50,"im":["d4a8f4418e81f3e418be50e900866399c1f3e48a"],"fa":"پین‌بار بیشتر شبیه این است\n\nویژگی‌های تشکیل پین‌بار\n\n• پین‌بار باید دُم بلند بالا یا پایین داشته باشد… به دُم گاهی «ویک» یا «سایه» هم می‌گویند… همه‌شان یک معنی می‌دهند. همان بخش «نوک‌تیز» پین‌بار است که واقعاً شبیه «دُم» به‌نظر می‌رسد و ريجکشن یا شکست جعلی یک سطح را نشان می‌دهد.\n\n• ناحیهٔ بین باز و بستهٔ پین‌بار «بدنه» یا «بدنهٔ واقعی» نامیده می‌شود. معمولاً وقتی بسته بالاتر از باز باشد سفید یا رنگ روشن دیگری است و وقتی بسته پایین‌تر از باز باشد سیاه یا رنگ تیرهٔ دیگری.\n\n• باز و بستهٔ پین‌بار باید خیلی نزدیک هم یا برابر (هم‌قیمت) باشند، هرچه نزدیک‌تر بهتر.\n\n• باز و بستهٔ پین‌بار نزدیک یکی از دو سر کندل است، هرچه نزدیک‌تر به سر، بهتر.\n\n• سایه یا دُم پین‌بار از کندل‌های قیمتی اطراف بیرون می‌زند، هرچه دُم پین‌بار بلندتر بهتر.\n\n• یک «قاعدهٔ سرانگشتی» کلی این است که می‌خواهی دُم پین‌بار دو‌سوم کل طول پین‌بار یا بیشتر باشد و بقیهٔ پین‌بار یک‌سوم کل طول یا کمتر.\n\n• سر مقابل دُم را گاهی «بینی» می‌نامند","ib":{"d4a8f4418e81f3e418be50e900866399c1f3e48a":0},"m":1244},{"id":"dbrrbd_p50_1245","t":"thx roqallo for enlightening me about pin bars n ur kind reply...will take care of all this stuff from now on...","a":"nysforex","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#1245","p":50,"im":[],"fa":"ممنون roqallo که دربارهٔ پین‌بارها روشنم کردی و جواب مهربانت… از این به بعد حواسم به همهٔ این چیزها هست…","m":1245},{"id":"dbrrbd_p50_1246","t":"","a":"JB888","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#1246","p":50,"im":["a2b7d5e1f4a8c47310626612c29112affcbbe0e2"],"ib":{"a2b7d5e1f4a8c47310626612c29112affcbbe0e2":0},"m":1246},{"id":"dbrrbd_p50_1247","t":"","a":"JB888","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#1247","p":50,"im":["c2fd425da143d35d24a189d702eab631118c3abf"],"ib":{"c2fd425da143d35d24a189d702eab631118c3abf":0},"m":1247},{"id":"dbrrbd_p50_1248","t":"","a":"JB888","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#1248","p":50,"im":["f2657204e43b34a1f91cf1739971dd00d43efbd4","ee8ee6d616cb5b1ca9b7e94e3d34e553c1bf024b"],"ib":{"f2657204e43b34a1f91cf1739971dd00d43efbd4":0,"ee8ee6d616cb5b1ca9b7e94e3d34e553c1bf024b":0},"m":1248},{"id":"dbrrbd_p50_1249","t":"nysforex wrote: HI m new to this PA n posting a chart of usd/chf M1 in the last minutes of market on friday... i hv asked sm queries kindly reply me as i dnt knw anything n want to learn PA properly... n please leave ur suggestions n if i hv made any mistakes kindly lemme know so that i can improve upon them...\n\nregards nys\n\nHi Here at RTM we dont trade pin bars, inside bars etc, I think i read somewhere IF said that closing of bar have no significance when placing a trade. We trade areas instead, and figuring out where these areas are is what we try to learn.","a":"TheLastNail","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#1249","p":50,"im":["0c53cce97365f88b96fcfe1319c1cc6f2d5dcfc2"],"fa":"nysforex نوشت: سلام، من در PA تازه‌ام و چارتی از usd/chf M1 در دقایق آخر بازار روز جمعه می‌گذارم… چند سؤال هم پرسیده‌ام، لطفاً جوابم را بدهید چون هیچی نمی‌دانم و می‌خواهم PA را درست یاد بگیرم… لطفاً پیشنهادهایتان را هم بگذارید و اگر اشتباهی کرده‌ام بگویید تا بهتر شوم…\n\nبا احترام nys\n\nسلام. اینجا در RTM ما پین‌بار، اینساید بار و از این قبیل معامله نمی‌کنیم. فکر می‌کنم جایی خواندم IF گفته بود بسته شدن کندل هنگام گذاشتن معامله اهمیتی ندارد. ما در عوض ناحیه معامله می‌کنیم، و اینکه بفهمیم این ناحیه‌ها کجا هستند همان چیزی است که سعی می‌کنیم یاد بگیریم.","ib":{"0c53cce97365f88b96fcfe1319c1cc6f2d5dcfc2":2},"m":1249},{"id":"dbrrbd_p50_1250","t":"","a":"JB888","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#1250","p":50,"im":["eb959ee100095f13a682d8ebb6e35a0ff224f069","971ef7d16f82a04ac3a99fc6c3e3717bf9080672"],"ib":{"eb959ee100095f13a682d8ebb6e35a0ff224f069":0,"971ef7d16f82a04ac3a99fc6c3e3717bf9080672":0},"m":1250}],"images":[{"k":"a0524f803833423cccbede0330e0bfc8443520af","t":"assets/thumbs/a0524f803833423cccbede0330e0bfc8443520af.webp","f":"assets/images/a0524f803833423cccbede0330e0bfc8443520af.webp","w":1366,"h":628,"b":40020,"o":"a0524f803833423cccbede0330e0bfc8443520af.png","p":50,"pid":"dbrrbd_p50_1226"},{"k":"9ac27a2e19a773d1461fe42dea3b54b26d11e490","t":"assets/thumbs/9ac27a2e19a773d1461fe42dea3b54b26d11e490.webp","f":"assets/images/9ac27a2e19a773d1461fe42dea3b54b26d11e490.webp","w":1366,"h":630,"b":37074,"o":"9ac27a2e19a773d1461fe42dea3b54b26d11e490.png","p":50,"pid":"dbrrbd_p50_1227"},{"k":"eee4feed661a543eb83b651d5e87c9f13c92b0f1","t":"assets/thumbs/eee4feed661a543eb83b651d5e87c9f13c92b0f1.webp","f":"assets/images/eee4feed661a543eb83b651d5e87c9f13c92b0f1.webp","w":1366,"h":629,"b":41162,"o":"eee4feed661a543eb83b651d5e87c9f13c92b0f1.png","p":50,"pid":"dbrrbd_p50_1228"},{"k":"16c3f31aca22790e0f17715568aeb9faf47b910d","t